OL,3,GNEWSAForecaster helps filmmakers
OL,4,Are-tell story of D-Day
OL,5,
OL,6,FA retired meteorologist has helped
OL,7,Ffilmmakers tell the story of the D-Day
OL,8,Flandings from a new perspective.
OL,10,FMartin Young was one of the technical
OL,11,Fadvisers on the set of the film
OL,12,FPressure, which tells the story of the
OL,13,Fchallenges facing weather forecasters
OL,14,Fbefore the largest seaborne operation
OL,15,Fof the Second World War.
OL,17,FThe job allowed him to combine his
OL,18,Finterest in the history of meteorology,
OL,19,Fwith his experience as a former chief
OL,20,Fforecaster for the Met Office.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
