OL,3,GNEWSAForecaster helps filmmakers
OL,4,Are-tell story of D-Day
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrom advising on the technicalities of
OL,7,Fweather dialogue, to hand-drawing
OL,8,Fcharts, he helped the producers portray
OL,9,Fthe scientific and practical realities
OL,10,Fof providing a forecast in the hours
OL,11,Fbefore D-Day.
